"Base.HeroPanel.PantheonExplanationè<style=HL2>Orichalcum Tokens</style>
Three tiers of Orichalcum tokens are used to unlock Pantheon nodes. Orichalcum Shards are spent on Layers 1 and 2. Orichalcum Ore is spent on Layers 3 and 4. Orichalcum Ingots are spent on Layers 5 and 6. Ingots are Premium tokens and are class-specific, meaning each hero class requires its own Ingot type.

<style=HL2>Node Activation</style>
Each of Layers 1 through 5 contains 4 nodes, but you may only activate 2 of them. Your selections are locked until you reset the tree.

<style=HL2>Star-Level Requirements</style>
Advancing through the Pantheon requires a minimum Star level for your hero. Layers 1 through 3 have no Star requirement. Layer 4 requires 3 Stars or higher. Layer 5 requires 4 Stars or higher. Layer 6 requires 5 Stars.

<style=HL2>Resetting the Tree</style>
