KBase.EventDungeonInfoPopup.BattleEvent_OdysseyEvent_ScyllaDungeon.StoryDescáThe seas of the world darken as your fleet enters the cursed strait. On either side, knife-edged cliffs claw at the heavens, and from the hollowed stone comes a sound no sailor forgets.<br><br>A hiss.<br>A shriek.<br>A hunger no oar can outrun.<br><br>From her cavern rises Scylla, deathless terror of the deep. An ancient horror of the rocks. She has waited in shadow for the next hull to pass too near. Crews vanish in her grasp. Oars go silent in her wake.<br><br>Even Odysseus, breaker of sieges and master of cunning, once paid her toll in blood: six of his finest sailors torn from his decks in a single, helpless pass.<br><br>But this time, you do not come to survive.<br>You come to end her.<br><br>With storm-forged power in your hands and legendary champions at your side, you will do what fear forbade: strike Scylla head-on, sever every snapping maw, and wrench these waters from her terror forever.<br><br>Rally your heroes. Command the lightning.<br>Break the beast, survive the passage, then set your sails for home.8
