The sacred lands of Egypt drown in unnatural darkness. From the depths of Duat, Anubis has emerged. A towering colossus of divine fury who waited eons for this moment. The God of Death walks among the living once more, his army of the reanimated dead rising from their tombs to sweep across the kingdom like a plague. He saw weakness in Egypt's young Pharaoh and seized his chance to shatter the barrier between worlds. Shadows creep through every street. The screams of the innocent echo beneath an eclipsed sun.<br><br>Young Tutankhamun stands defiant, though fear gnaws at his heart. Too young, they whispered. Too weak to lead. But as he watches his people flee in terror, something ignites within him. A fire that no god can extinguish. He will NOT be the Pharaoh who let Egypt fall. He will NOT be forgotten as the king who cowered while darkness consumed everything he swore to protect.<br><br>The call has gone out across time itself. Heroes from every age have answered. Warriors, scholars, legends who've faced impossible odds before. Together with Tut, you form the last line of defense against oblivion. Anubis believes this world is his for the taking, that no mortal can stand against a god's wrath.<br><br>Prove him wrong. Fight back the darkness. Send Anubis back to the abyss where he belongs.ê
