*Base.PvpEliteInfoPopup.PvpEliteExplanationÄ<style=HL2><sprite name=pvp_points>Points</style>
Gain or lose points in each round. The maximum gain/loss is shown above the attack button for each opponent. A 3‚Äì0 win gains more points than a 2‚Äì1 win, while a 0‚Äì3 defeat loses more points than a 1‚Äì2 defeat. The outcome of every round is significant.

<style=HL2>Opponent Info</style>
Next to each opponent's name, you'll see their current points and each team's battle power.

<style=HL2>Your Info</style>
On the right side, view your current rank, total points, and your teams' battle power.

<style=HL2>Three rounds battle</style>
Each battle consists of 3 rounds, and you need to form 3 teams. Each hero can appear in at most 1 of these teams.

<style=HL2>Combat Mechanic</style>
Above Your Info is the Combat Mechanic, which affects both you and your opponent. It changes every two weeks.

<sprite name=elite_arena_medals> <style=HL2>Elite Arena Medals</style>
For every battle, regardless of the outcome, you earn 3 Elite Arena Medals. These Medals serve as currency in the Arena Shop.

<style=HL2>Arena Shop</style>
Use your Elite Arena Medals to purchase various items available in the shop.

<style=HL2>Season Rewards</style>
Below your team power, check the rewards for your current rank for the season.

<sprite name=elite_arena_token> <style=HL2>Elite Arena Tokens</style>
Each fight costs 1 Elite Arena Token, which regenerate over time, up to a maximum of 5.

<style=HL2>Season Points Reset</style>
